`,(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"This course lightly covers the foundational AI Fluency concepts. However, for deeper understanding, participants should complete AI Fluency: Framework & Foundations before beginning this student-focused curriculum."}),`
`,(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:"It is also recommended that learners have access to an AI chat tool for hands-on practice. Examples in this course will use Claude.ai, but any chatbot will work."}),`
